Reproduction unavailable \({{ (f.reproduction.reason or "not_reproducible") | replace("_", " ") | md }}\)\. Run gazua run \-\-{{ f.mode }} \-\-mold {{ f.mold_id | md }} with the same configuration\.

{% endif %}
Confirm the fix, with the current configuration and baseline:

{% for label, command in item.confirm %}
{{ label | md }}:

{{ command | block("") }}

{% endfor %}
